exports[`TUI rendering > help overlay lists every binding 1`] = `
"orbit │ ● live │ 0/2 running │ mock · Demo mode                                                                   ? help
╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  Keys (j/k scroll · ? or Esc closes)                                                   ║
║  Tab / Shift-Tab, h l, 1 2 3  move between Bots, Timeline and Approvals                ║
║  j k / ↓ ↑                    move the selection (Timeline: scroll)                    ║
║  [ ]                          older / newer Run of the selected Bot                    ║
║  r                            run the selected Bot now                                 ║
║  p                            pause / resume the selected Bot                          ║
║  s                            stop the selected Run (Timeline)                         ║
║  u                            resume a parked or rate-limited Run (Timeline)           ║
║  t                            delegation tree of the Run (Timeline)                    ║
║  + / -                        rate a finished Run (Timeline)                           ║
║  m                            the selected Bot's memory (Bots pane)                    ║
║  Enter / (memory)             open a memory / search memories                          ║
║  e  x (memory)                edit / delete (asks first)                               ║
║  T  P (memory)                mark reviewed and trusted / pin                          ║
║  Ctrl-S (editing)             save; Tab: title or text; Esc: back                      ║
║  g G                          Timeline top / follow live                               ║
║  Enter / a                    open the whole card; a there approves                    ║
║  A (in the card)              approve and always allow this tool for the Bot (7 days)  ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
"
`;

